{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_179_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_179","textTraditional":"一、二十有九年，春，公在楚。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_179_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_179","textTraditional":"閔公也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_179_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_179","textTraditional":"二、夏，五月，公至自楚。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_179_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_179","textTraditional":"喜之也。致君者，殆其往，而喜其反，此致君之意義也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_179_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_179","textTraditional":"三、庚午，衞侯衎卒。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_179_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_179","textTraditional":"四、閽弒吳子餘祭。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_179_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_179","textTraditional":"閽，門者也，寺人也。不稱名姓，閽不得齊於人。不稱其君，閽不得君其君也。禮，君不使無恥，不近刑人，不狎敵，不邇怨。賤人非所貴也，貴人非所刑也，刑人非所近也。舉至賤而加之吳，吳子近刑人也。閽弒吳子餘祭，仇人也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_179_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_179","textTraditional":"五、仲孫羯會晉荀盈、齊高止、宋華定、衞世叔儀、鄭公孫段、曹人、莒人、邾人、滕人、薛人、小邾人，城杞。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_179_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_179","textTraditional":"古者，天子封諸侯，其地足以容其民，其民足以滿城以自守也。杞危而不能自守，故諸侯之大夫相帥以城之，此變之正也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_179_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_179","textTraditional":"六、晉侯使士鞅來聘。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_179_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_179","textTraditional":"七、杞子來盟。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_179_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_179","textTraditional":"八、吳子使札來聘。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_179_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_179","textTraditional":"吳其稱子何也？善使延陵季子，故進之也。身賢，賢也。使賢，亦賢也。延陵季子之賢，尊君也。其名，成尊於上也。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_179_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_179","textTraditional":"九、秋，九月，葬衞獻公。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_179_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_179","textTraditional":"十、齊高止出奔北燕。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_179_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_179","textTraditional":"其曰北燕，從史文也。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_clt_179_17","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_179","textTraditional":"十一、冬，仲孫羯如晉。","sentenceOrder":17}],"overrides":{}}